msgid ""
"%ls\n"
"\n"
"An error report was saved to:\n"
"%ls\n"
"\n"
"To let the BRODALF developers know, post it as a new issue at %ls. The report starts with step-by-step instructions.\n"
"\n"
"Show the report file now?"
